hold_up_cap25_delay50us
Vsource source 0 4.5
Vcontrol control 0 PWL(0 3.3 0.0009999 3.3 0.001 0 0.00105 0 0.0010501 3.3 .003 3.3)
Ssource source feed control 0 IDEAL_MUX
.model IDEAL_MUX SW(Ron=.05 Roff=1e12 Vt=1.65 Vh=0)
Rpath feed sys .05
Resr sys cap .02
Csys cap 0 1.65e-05
Rbulk sys bulk .12
Cbulk bulk 0 376u
Bload sys 0 I=2*min(max(v(sys)/3,0),1)
Rleak sys 0 1G
.options reltol=.001 abstol=1n vntol=1u
.tran 100n .003
.end
